---
// Hero component for Career page
---

<section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950 to-gray-900 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 w-72 h-72 bg-green-400 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20 text-green-400 text-sm font-medium rounded-full mb-6">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path d="M13 6a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zM18 8a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM14 15a4 4 0 00-8 0v3h8v-3zM6 8a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM16 18v-3a5.972 5.972 0 00-.75-2.906A3.005 3.005 0 0119 15v3h-3zM4.75 12.094A5.973 5.973 0 004 15v3H1v-3a3 3 0 013.75-2.906z"/>
        </svg>
        Trabaja con Nosotros
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Construye el futuro<br/>
        <span class="text-green-400">junto a nosotros</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
        En Agoramy estamos construyendo tecnología que transforma negocios mexicanos. Si te apasiona resolver problemas reales con software, este es tu lugar.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#vacantes" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-green-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-green-600 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/25 transition-all">
          Ver Vacantes
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-white/5 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
          Enviar CV Espontáneo
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
